  "entries": [
    {
      "movingLine": 1,
      "changedTrigram": "坎",
      "text": "方位取北，坎的场所见水边、酒醋之旁。原来若确实在相应场所停留，可先问招领与当时收拾，查询从最有用的实据做起。",
      "sourceRule": "坎",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:22:22.034Z",
      "textSha256": "c42c699913650a02397d81bb9d00b67e7204b8fa828887f5c3fe8e76192ec328"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 2,
      "changedTrigram": "震",
      "text": "传统取象偏东，场所看闹市、大途。若要请人补问，可将确知携物经过的那一段交准，先核实际停留处，少让询查绕远。",
      "sourceRule": "震",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:22:22.034Z",
      "textSha256": "b6fd6bc79fc4562f3fa159691447629981fd60aea18e6805787f8c109a77061f"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 3,
      "changedTrigram": "乾",
      "text": "西北及高处、圆器之中是变乾的线索。若同批物件分开放过，可先核原物实际进过哪个容器，再由能查看的人辨认。",
      "sourceRule": "乾",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:22:22.034Z",
      "textSha256": "8c502128fda97414b66ed23f502ec13b9130fc8c0e4ce93ba5f7d32167decc84"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 4,
      "changedTrigram": "离",
      "text": "方位可参南，离列明窗、文书旁。若早先查验有一处明显缺漏，可请原处补看那次文件收拾与夹放，先把能核的问题解决。",
      "sourceRule": "离",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:22:22.034Z",
      "textSha256": "8f1619ded14b69d40279cd408a1494a1d1371c283b5765fe939bf63a5fc41cf0"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 5,
      "changedTrigram": "巽",
      "text": "东南与木器之内属于变巽的场所取象。若已有合用的协查条件，可请原经手者核实际用过的木柜，把原件照片与独有痕迹交齐。",
      "sourceRule": "巽",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:22:22.034Z",
      "textSha256": "948378d0f806d6756052e1f0ffb0985e1406de70b1aa875b58bc6fa691f8e5b2"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 6,
      "changedTrigram": "坤",
      "text": "取象在西南，场所见仓储、方器。若原处有人能承担查验，可托其核真实收存的盒格，找到相似物时再对原记录细辨。",
      "sourceRule": "坤",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:22:22.035Z",
      "textSha256": "828f43f7b0d33419f3d4014fe068d7b175396fd771caa7989fe5e8fb3f97de4c"
    }
  ]
}
